  "content": {
    "id": "p17-q2-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "2",
    "prompt": "Solve, for the domain $x\\in[0,2\\pi)$. Answer in radians to 3 d.p.",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 3,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p17-q2-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$\\sin x=0.316$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=0.322,\\ 2.820$",
          "worked": "The reference angle is $A=\\sin^{-1}(0.316)$. Since $\\sin x>0$, use quadrants I and II.\n$$\\begin{align*}x&=A\\quad\\text{or}\\quad\\pi-A\\\\x&=0.322\\quad\\text{or}\\quad2.820\\quad\\text{(3 d.p.)}.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 29
      },
      {
        "id": "p17-q2-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$2\\cos x=-0.689$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=1.923,\\ 4.361$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}2\\cos x&=-0.689\\\\\\cos x&=-0.3445\\end{align*}$$\nThe reference angle is $A=\\cos^{-1}(0.3445)$. Since $\\cos x<0$, use quadrants II and III.\n$$\\begin{align*}x&=\\pi-A\\quad\\text{or}\\quad\\pi+A\\\\x&=1.923\\quad\\text{or}\\quad4.361\\quad\\text{(3 d.p.)}.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 34
      },
      {
        "id": "p17-q2-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$\\tan x=-\\dfrac{3}{7}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=2.737,\\ 5.878$",
          "worked": "The reference angle is $A=\\tan^{-1}\\left(\\frac37\\right)$. Since $\\tan x<0$, use quadrants II and IV.\n$$\\begin{align*}x&=\\pi-A\\quad\\text{or}\\quad2\\pi-A\\\\x&=2.737\\quad\\text{or}\\quad5.878\\quad\\text{(3 d.p.)}.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 31
      }
    ]
